WEBVTT

00:10:26.455 --> 00:10:31.460
In the future,
if we don't decide to change

00:10:31.502 --> 00:10:34.296
The things we cannot save

00:10:34.296 --> 00:10:38.592
But it slows to shine upon your face

00:10:39.218 --> 00:10:42.262
We owe everything

00:10:43.806 --> 00:10:45.349
Everything

00:10:47.309 --> 00:10:48.894
Everything

00:10:49.269 --> 00:10:52.189
To this rainbow of suffering

00:10:53.732 --> 00:10:58.529
Light is particle and wave